{
  "$comment": "Source of truth for check-component-token-binding.mjs: which component source consumes each component.* token group. Leaves are inferred from their names (height, paddingX, iconSize, bg, bgHover, ...; table PROP_BY_NAME in scripts/lib/component-token-binding.mjs); rules[] override the cva context, property or state. A rule's match is a dotted leaf path where * captures one segment as $1. state lists the Tailwind variant prefixes to look through, most specific first ('' is the resting state). Allowlist a deliberate literal with an inline `binding-ok: <group>.<leaf> <reason>` comment in the source.",
  "scan": ["src/app/components"],
  "groups": {
    "button": {
